1
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,820
♪Let me write the legend♪

2
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:13,580
=Young Swordsman=

3
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:16,580
=Episode 26=

4
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:26,640
Are you okay?

5
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:34,320
Go!

6
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,680
(Heroes' Monument)

7
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,320
If you're all so eager to join

8
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,560
Peng Dasheng in death,

9
00:00:51,039 --> 00:00:52,560
I'll grant your wish.

10
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:58,399
Ziting!

11
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:04,599
Ms. Duan, take the others and go.

12
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:06,920
If we go, we go together.

13
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:09,280
Xiao, let's take him on together!

14
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,760
Ms. Duan!

15
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,359
Four weaklings

16
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:04,840
are still just weaklings.

17
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,560
Peng Dasheng,

18
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:12,599
you're next.

19
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:26,280
Murong Xiang!

20
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:33,680
Prepare to die!

21
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,240
Life is fleeting,

22
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,639
like grass through a single autumn.

23
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,599
But if I can't live true to myself,

24
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:56,639
what good is immortality?

25
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,639
Master always says fate can't be defied.

26
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:00,919
Yet he did

27
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,840
everything he could to keep me alive.

28
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,479
He could defy fate to save me.

29
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:07,719
Why can't I break free from it?

30
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:10,919
We all get one turn in this world.

31
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,520
Instead of living in fear,

32
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:14,439
I'd rather give it everything I've got.

33
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,120
Even if I can't win,

34
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:18,520
I'll still fight.

35
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:21,039
Even with only a slim chance,

36
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,800
I'll stake my life on it.

37
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:24,879
Let heaven and earth be my battlefield,

38
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,360
and the stars my blade.

39
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:28,000
(Heroes' Monument)
Even if I'm torn to pieces,

40
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,360
I won't be afraid.

41
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:30,759
Now that's

42
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:32,680
a life worth living.

43
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,800
My fate

44
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:36,280
is mine to decide.

45
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:42,199
Heaven's Doom Descent!

46
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:57,560
A deafening boom rang out.

47
00:03:57,599 --> 00:04:01,280
Everyone there was struck with terror,

48
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,879
then bled from every orifice and died.

49
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,719
Ancient calamities took many forms,

50
00:04:05,719 --> 00:04:07,879
but none was fiercer than this.

51
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:09,000
So what happened to Peng Dasheng?

52
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Yeah, what happened next?

53
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,719
Come on, keep going!

54
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:13,039
The story goes...

55
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:16,600
Peng Dasheng saw everyone he loved die

56
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:19,519
and thought, "Alas...

57
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:21,480
Even if I survive alone,

58
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,120
- what good would it do?"
- Enjoy your meal, sir.

59
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:27,720
He then drew his sword
and took his own life.

60
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,720
He killed himself?

61
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,160
Wuji.

62
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,519
What kind of ending is that?

63
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,920
Who'd buy a book

64
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,120
with an ending that bad?

65
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,360
I heard the author once said

66
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,079
the story was unfinished

67
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,800
and was waiting
for the right person to finish it.

68
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,079
Oh well.

69
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,680
I've been killed off
so many times already.

70
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,639
What's one more?

71
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,079
Master,

72
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,160
you're heading back to Gusu today.

73
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,879
Are you really leaving
without telling Mr. Xiao and the others?

74
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:52,120
They'll be upset

75
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,319
if you leave without saying goodbye.

76
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:55,839
Forget it.

77
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,920
They've got their hands full lately.

78
00:04:58,319 --> 00:04:59,399
They started a new group

79
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:01,639
to settle disputes in the martial world.

80
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:02,839
What was it called?

81
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:04,920
The Hall of Truce.

82
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:06,399
Right.

83
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:12,639
- Congratulations!
- Thank you.

84
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:15,920
Same to you! Same to you!

85
00:05:16,319 --> 00:05:17,399
Same to you! Same to you!

86
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,160
(Hall of Truce)
Same to you!

87
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,980
(Hall of Truce)

88
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,040
Didn't we agree

89
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,560
on the Martial Dispute Council?

90
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,240
It's straightforward.

91
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,720
Everyone knows exactly what we do.

92
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,959
(Hall of Truce)
I still think

93
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:29,439
the Hall of Truce sounds better.

94
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:30,560
It has more class.

95
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,839
Pretty boy,

96
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,519
don't make me slap you

97
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:35,759
in the most peaceful place on earth.

98
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:36,920
You've got two hours.

99
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,480
Change that ridiculous sign back.

100
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,199
Not a chance.

101
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:42,720
Then don't blame me.

102
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,279
What are you doing?

103
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:45,399
Get to it!

104
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,480
Why are you grabbing me?

105
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,480
You shoved me?

106
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,759
I'll kick you for that!

107
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:49,879
(Hall of Truce)
Pretty boy!

108
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:50,680
(Hall of Truce)
I've had enough of you!

109
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,199
(Hall of Truce)
Come here!

110
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,800
(Hall of Truce)
I've had enough of you!

111
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,720
(Hall of Truce)
Come on! Just you wait!

112
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,240
(Hall of Truce)
Scared of you?

113
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:56,120
(Hall of Truce)

114
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,000
(Hall of Truce)
All right, all right!

115
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,000
(After the Battle of the Busi Sea)

116
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,839
(Murong Xiang died
in the Heaven's Doom Descent,)

117
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,439
(and the rest of us barely survived.)

118
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:12,600
(Changsheng was chosen
as the new Martial Alliance Leader.)

119
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,480
(He pushed through the opposition
and founded a martial academy.)

120
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,879
(Students were chosen on merit,)

121
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,399
(regardless of background.)

122
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:21,199
(The martial world
had been stagnant for years,)

123
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:23,600
(but he finally
brought it back to life.)

124
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:26,040
(Martial Legacy Academy)
Greetings, Alliance Leader.

125
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,960
(Martial Legacy Academy)

126
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:32,399
(After Murong Manor was seized,)

127
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,360
(Murong Bingqing left without a word)

128
00:06:34,439 --> 00:06:35,759
(and vanished without a trace.)

129
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,600
(Some say she went to Mount Emei,)

130
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,600
(shaved her head and became a nun,)

131
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,560
(spending the rest of her life
in quiet devotion.)

132
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,079
(Others say)

133
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:45,279
(she joined Lingjiu Palace
on Mount Tianshan and became)

134
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:47,759
(Betrothal Contract)
(the master's prized final disciple.)

135
00:06:48,759 --> 00:06:50,160
(But rumors in the martial world)

136
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,879
(are like tales told in teahouses.)

137
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:53,000
(They're fun to hear,)

138
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,360
(but no one takes them seriously.)

139
00:06:56,340 --> 00:06:59,820
♪I'll step on fate and grow beyond it♪

140
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:00,580
(Betrothal Contract)

141
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:01,780
♪I rise against fate and fight♪

142
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,720
(As for me, Peng Dasheng,)

143
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,040
(I decided to leave)

144
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,000
(the martial world
I never truly belonged in.)

145
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,319
(However,)

146
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:14,399
(it seemed
I'd gained a traveling companion.)

147
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,399
Miss,

148
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:17,600
are you really leaving with that boy?

149
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:20,600
Xiao, the Wudu Sect is in your hands.

150
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:22,959
Don't worry, Miss.

151
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:25,040
I'll take good care of the Wudu Sect

152
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,519
until you return.

153
00:07:27,959 --> 00:07:30,600
Miss, if there's an emergency,

154
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,480
where can I find you?

155
00:07:32,879 --> 00:07:34,759
Somewhere in the martial world.

156
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:38,620
♪Even if the ending
is nothing but desolation♪

157
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:40,940
♪I rise against fate and fight♪

158
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:43,900
♪My blood runs hot, my heart runs wild♪

159
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:47,180
♪I won't live for someone else's glory♪

160
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:52,100
♪I only want to shine
with a light of my own♪

161
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:03,839
Master, Peng Guifa pays his respects.

162
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,920
Why are you here?

163
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,959
Master,

164
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:09,439
Dasheng has overcome
his destined tribulation.

165
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,360
He should be back at the sect

166
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,079
in a few days.

167
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,399
I have a question,

168
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:15,560
if I may.

169
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:18,759
Should we tell him
you personally taught him

170
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:21,199
the Formless Divine Art?

171
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:22,800
No.

172
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:24,639
But

173
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:27,720
Dasheng is your own grandson.

174
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:30,639
Don't you want to tell him the truth

175
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:32,399
and finally be a family?

176
00:08:32,399 --> 00:08:33,879
It's been twenty years.

177
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:36,720
If I'd wanted to see him, I would have.

178
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,720
Why wait until now?

179
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,639
Master...

180
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,919
This blade is named Battlebreaker.

181
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:49,080
I wielded it myself years ago.

182
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,879
Give it to him for me.

183
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:53,279
Just don't tell him it came from me.

184
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:56,480
(He gives away
a legendary weapon just like that.)

185
00:08:56,639 --> 00:09:00,399
(The older Master gets, the harder
it is for him to admit he cares.)

186
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,799
Yes, Master.

187
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:06,279
(Tang Clan)
(In this world,)

188
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:07,480
(Tang Clan)
(the forces of good and evil)

189
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:10,440
(are like yin and yang,
opposing yet sustaining each other.)

190
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:13,480
(Though Murong Xiang
was destroyed at the Busi Sea,)

191
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:16,399
(the remnants of his
soul-devouring demonic energy survived)

192
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,679
(and found a new host.)

193
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:23,879
(A new calamity was brewing
in the shadows of the martial world.)

194
00:09:37,559 --> 00:09:39,399
Your time is almost up.

195
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:43,159
Are you really content
to become nothing but dust?

196
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,200
Who are you?

197
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:46,639
Who I am doesn't matter.

198
00:09:46,799 --> 00:09:48,039
What matters is

199
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:51,200
I can free you from mortality

200
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,559
and let you live forever.

201
00:10:20,740 --> 00:10:21,220
♪Come on♪

202
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,420
♪This battle, I won't retreat♪

203
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:31,340
♪In worn-out clothes,
my hem still carries frost and dust♪

204
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:34,540
♪Among the crowd,
who is laughing at my absurdity?♪

205
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:37,620
♪They say my birth
has already decided my path♪

206
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:40,620
♪But I refuse
to believe my birth decides my worth♪

207
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:44,100
♪With one blade in hand,
I've weathered countless storms♪

208
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:47,340
♪Covered in scars,
only to be called young and reckless♪

209
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:50,420
♪If this world only bows
to status and bloodlines♪

210
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:53,340
♪Then I'll break every rule
with a single slash♪

211
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:57,220
♪Listen, this heartbeat echoes♪

212
00:10:57,260 --> 00:11:00,260
♪Fate is nothing but a net♪

213
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:05,940
♪Either be trapped by it
or tear it apart♪

214
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:08,380
♪I rise against fate and fight♪

215
00:11:08,940 --> 00:11:11,460
♪I don't believe
anyone is born above another♪

216
00:11:12,180 --> 00:11:14,580
♪Even this mortal body
dares to fight back♪

217
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:18,380
♪I'll step on fate and grow beyond it♪

218
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:21,100
♪I rise against fate and fight♪

219
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:24,140
♪Even if the world's cold stares
stand in my way♪

220
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:27,580
♪This blade will cut through
all worldly judgment♪

221
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:31,900
♪I am my own king♪

222
00:11:44,980 --> 00:11:46,540
♪I emerge into the world♪

223
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:48,300
♪Unknown, yet I dare
to shake the martial world♪

224
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:49,660
♪My pride is my trump card♪

225
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:51,460
♪Even if fate treats me as worthless,
I refuse to yield♪

226
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:52,860
♪Born with a gift, I won't give in♪

227
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:54,620
♪Against heaven's will,
I'll bet on my rise♪

228
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:56,140
♪A sword in hand,
fresh out of the mountain♪

229
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:57,860
♪I dare to break every rule♪

230
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:59,180
♪I see through
the masks of human hearts♪

231
00:11:59,180 --> 00:12:01,020
♪Famous clans are nothing
but a few layers of disguise♪

232
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:02,260
♪They kneel and beg for fame♪

233
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:04,500
♪I stand and fight for my dignity♪

234
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:06,020
♪Facing powerful foes, I will not bow♪

235
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:07,620
♪With my blade in hand,
I decide what is right♪

236
00:12:07,620 --> 00:12:09,220
♪Stand for justice and never step back♪

237
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:10,940
♪Even if the whole world
stands against me♪

238
00:12:10,940 --> 00:12:12,660
♪Untamed,
frost has carved me to the bone♪

239
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:14,020
♪Only then do I become more like myself♪

240
00:12:14,020 --> 00:12:15,660
♪Fight, this life of mine is unyielding♪

241
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:17,140
♪No matter how dark the martial world,
I'll walk through it♪

242
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:18,860
♪For love, I do not fight for the world♪

243
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:20,460
♪I only want
to protect her for a lifetime♪

244
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:22,020
♪Carefree,
this fleeting life is but a brief stay♪

245
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:26,340
♪Now I know all things can be overcome♪

246
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:28,500
♪I raise my blade and change my fate♪

247
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:31,100
♪Let me write the legend♪

248
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:38,540
♪I rise against fate and fight♪

249
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:41,860
♪Win or lose, strong or weak,
none of it matters to me♪

250
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:44,340
♪Even if I fall, I will still shine♪

251
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:48,420
♪Let my name
be carved into the vast world♪

252
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:51,380
♪I rise against fate and fight♪

253
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:53,860
♪If this world refuses to forgive me♪

254
00:12:53,860 --> 00:12:56,900
♪Then I'll burn away
all my edge and brilliance♪

255
00:12:56,900 --> 00:13:01,940
♪And trade it for a new dawn♪
